     201You are standing, badly befuddled, in a pale purple fog.
     202You are wandering around in the middle of a bright red fog.
     203You are lost in the midst of a thick, pea-green fog.
     204You are trying to find your way through a dense coal-black fog.
     205You are lost in the heart of a strange yellow fog.
     206You are standing, badly bedazzled, in a day-glow orange fog.
     207You are hunting your way through a shimmering magenta fog.
     208You are somewhere in the center of a weird, pearly pink fog.
     209You are standing in a fog-filled room next to a tall cairn of glowing
     209rocks. An opening in the cairn leads down to a dark passage.
     210You're in a small, nondescript chamber. A dark passage leads up
     210and to the south, and a wide but low crawl leads north.
     211You're in a small room with a very smooth floor, onto which has
     211been marked a pentagram. A low crawl leads out to the west, and
     211a crack in the rock leads north.
     212The crack in the rock ends here, but a narrow chimney leads up.
     212You should be able to climb it.
     213You're at the top of a narrow chimney in the rock. A cylindrical
     213tube composed of hardened lava leads south.
     214The lava tube continues down and to the south, but it becomes very
     214steep here - if you go down it you probably won't be able to get
     214back up.
     215You are standing in a wide, north-and-south corridor.
     216You are standing at a bend in a wide corridor which runs to the east
     216and west. To the east, the corridor turns left and continues north;
     216to the west, it turns left and continues south.
     217You are in a small, low-ceilinged room with the words "Witt Company
     217Tool Room - Melenkurion division" carved into one of the walls. A
     217wide corridor runs south from here.
