     202             Translated from "Spelunker Today", May 1980 issue
     202                              -  -  -
     202                    *** More New Features ***
     202     The cave's most recent features aside from many new
     202locations and another treasure are five new commands.  The
     202first one is "FAST", which suppresses *all* long
     202descriptions. The second is "FULL", which prints only long
     202descriptions. The third is "LISTEN" which just tells what
     202sounds are around you. The fourth is "TURNS" which tells you
     202how many turns you have taken, and the last isn't new,
     202just modified. "SCORE" no longer asks you if you want to quit.
     202You may obtain information on other games by typing "GAMES".
     202To print the current version number, type ".". Over 50 new
     202rooms have been added for version 1.2.
     202Please contact jjl.sct if you have any problems or suggestions.
     203Other adventure-type games on Multics:
     203>udd>sct>jjl>g>explore {explore_exl}
     203>udd>micro>demo>atom2000
     203>udd>micro>demo>quest
     203>udd>micro>demo>wumpus (is Wumpus II)
     203>udd>med>wgk>jjl>adventure (this game)
